摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Paste images into DeepSeek Harness with a four-model vision race, OCR, and an automatic text bridge.","id":"gh:1333713489","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"ds-vision-plugin","slug":"Sorwcyra/ds-vision-plugin","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","image-to-text","multimodal","ocr","typescript","vision","vlm"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Paste images into DeepSeek Harness with a four-model vision race, OCR, and an automatic text bridge."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"ds-vision-plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Paste an image. Let four vision models race. Keep DeepSeek text-only."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Quick start"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Routing"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Verification"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"License"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"paste → attachment → race ×4 → grounded text → DeepSeek"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"An installable DeepSeek Harness bundle that gives a text-only DeepSeek model a natural image-input e"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"xperience. Paste or drop an image into the Web composer; the plugin reads Harness's verified attachm"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ent, races configured vision models or OCR, replaces the image with grounded text at `agent/pre-step"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"`, and lets DeepSeek continue normally."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> No Harness source fork is required. The plugin also exposes `vision_analyze` and `vision"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"_status` for workspace files and diagnostics."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Why it exists"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| User need | Plugin answer |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Paste screenshots directly into a text-only DeepSeek chat | Automatic Web attachment-to-text conve"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"rsion |\n| Avoid waiting on one slow or unavailable visual provider | Four models start together; fir"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"st valid result wins |\n| Reuse the proven `ds-vision-skill` route design | Agnes 2.5 + Agnes 2.0 + G"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"LM-4V-Flash + GLM-4.1V-Thinking-Flash |\n| Add a private relay, paid model, or local runtime | Unlimi"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"ted OpenAI-compatible race or fallback routes |\n| Configure without hand-editing YAML | Guided CLI f"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"or setup, keys, status, custom models, and live verification |\n| Keep failures understandable | Visi"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"ble annotation or strict failure; images are never silently discarded |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Why choose this plugin"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **Native paste/drop UX:** users attach images directly in the Harness Web composer without first s"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"aving a path or naming a tool.\n- **The proven `ds-vision-skill` four-model pattern:** Agnes 2.5, Agn"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"es 2.0, GLM-4V-Flash, and GLM-4.1V-Thinking-Flash start together; the first valid response is handed"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" to DeepSeek.\n- **No GLM 4.6 dependency:** the default configuration, routing, and tests contain no "},{"id":"p16s5","text":"`glm-4.6v-flash` route.\n- **No Harness source fork:** the implementation uses a scoped Host capabili"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"ty bridge, durable attachments, and the official `agent/pre-step` extension.\n- **Low setup friction:"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"** the CLI creates configuration, reports channel readiness, saves masked keys on Windows, adds arbi"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"trary OpenAI-compatible models, and verifies a real image.\n- **Open-ended routing:** user models are"},{"id":"p16s9","text":" not limited to three slots and can join either the concurrent race or ordered fallback.\n- **Explici"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"t failure behavior:** images are never silently discarded; deployments choose visible annotation or "},{"id":"p16s11","text":"ior:** images are never silently discarded; deployments choose visible annotation or strict failure."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The four-way race can start four provider requests for each uncached image. It is recommended when l"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"atency and availability matter most. If request count, cost, or data exposure matters more, remove c"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"hannels from `routing.race` or prefer local VLM/OCR routes."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Routing model"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- Automatic conversion for Web image attachments; default route filter: `deepseek-official`.\n- Multi"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ple images per message and images nested in tool results.\n- Four-model first-success race: `agnes-2."},{"id":"p20s3","text":"5-flash`, `agnes-2.0-flash`, `glm-4v-flash`, and `glm-4.1v-thinking-flash`; losing requests are canc"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"elled.\n- `glm-4.6v-flash` is not used.\n- Any number of user-owned OpenAI-compatible models can be ad"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"ded to the race or ordered fallback.\n- Prompt-aware OCR routing to Baidu OCR or local Tesseract; VLM"},{"id":"p20s6","text":" fallback if OCR is unavailable.\n- Custom hosted endpoints plus local Ollama/LM Studio support.\n- YA"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"ML hot reload, result caching, timeouts, size limits, and real-path confinement for the manual file "},{"id":"p20s8","text":"tool.\n- Strict failure or visible failure annotation; images are never silently dropped.\n- Secrets a"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"re named by environment variable and are not returned by `vision_status`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Requirements: Node.js 22.19+ or 24+. Run one command in PowerShell, Command Prompt, bash, or zsh:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The command installs or updates the plugin when needed, creates the four-model configuration without"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" overwriting an existing one, guides key setup, starts the Web profile on the Harness-configured def"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ault port, and opens the browser. The plugin does not override that default (currently 3080). Run th"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"e same command next time. If the default port is already serving, it simply opens the existing Web U"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"I instead of starting a duplicate process."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Useful options:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Option | Purpose |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| `npx -y github:Sorwcyra/ds-vision-plugin --update` | reinstall even when the package version match"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"es |\n| `npx -y github:Sorwcyra/ds-vision-plugin --port 8080` | explicitly override the Harness Web p"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ort |\n| `npx -y github:Sorwcyra/ds-vision-plugin --no-open` | start without opening a browser |\n| `n"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"px -y github:Sorwcyra/ds-vision-plugin --no-start` | install and configure only |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Manual installation and local development"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Using the prebuilt tarball:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Local checkout:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Configuration CLI"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"After installation, create the default four-model race and inspect missing keys:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Save GLM or Agnes keys interactively on Windows (input is masked):"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"One `GLM_API_KEY` enables both GLM models; one `AGNES_API_KEY` enables both Agnes models. Channels w"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ith missing keys are skipped immediately."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Run one live race and print the winning model:"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Add any OpenAI-compatible model without editing YAML:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Privacy and failure behavior"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"Automatic Web attachments are read only through Harness's verified private attachment service. A con"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"figured cloud channel receives the image bytes. `allowedRoots` applies to explicit file paths, not W"},{"id":"p46s3","text":"eb attachments. Use a local VLM/Tesseract or disable automatic conversion for sensitive images."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"The default `annotate` mode removes an unsupported image block only after emitting a clear conversio"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"n-failure marker, allowing DeepSeek to explain the issue. Use `error` when a failed conversion must "},{"id":"p47s3","text":" allowing DeepSeek to explain the issue. Use `error` when a failed conversion must stop the request."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
